，物体变形，透视畸变，水印，文字，卡通，手绘，油画，人物，多余杂物，过曝死黑，色彩错乱，格子大小不一致，空间造型改动。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 3, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.4958801269531, 407.2727355957031], "pos": [540.468505859375, 872.0730590820312], "widgets_values": [" 1   触发词：1 苹果手机实拍质感 通用空间渲染\n2｜触发词：2 通用光影洗图优化（效果图专用）\n3｜触发词：3 模型转实景｜午后暖调自然光渲染\n4｜触发词：4 清冷高级感 PBR 物理写实渲染"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 4, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [5, 11], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "原始大小", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [270, 330], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1069.6502685546875, 231.9769287109375], "widgets_values": ["3:2", 1, 1, "letterbox", "lanczos", "8", "None", 1024, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 4, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "proportional_width"}, {"widget": {"name": "pro